WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.210
- My neighbor is from Afghanistan,

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:09.516
and he has been telling me
some very horrible things.

00:00:09.516 --> 00:00:12.183
(intense music)

00:00:14.543 --> 00:00:16.700
(sirens)

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.920
- [Male Speaker 1] Last week as the US

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.940
was leaving Afghanistan,

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.000
after we've been there
for 20 years, the Taliban,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.900
which is a political and military group,

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.220
took over the entire country.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.970
And eventually made it to the Capitol,

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:33.210
where they ran the government
out of the country,

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.870
and declared themselves the
government of Afghanistan.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.620
They did this really fast,

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.490
faster than the US thought they would.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:44.240
Here's this map by EmperorTigerstar

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:47.450
showing just the last few
months of Afghanistan,

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:50.770
going from Afghan-controlled,
which is green,

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:53.911
to Taliban-controlled, which is white.

00:00:53.911 --> 00:00:54.873
- [Male Speaker 2] CNN, CNN, CNN.

00:00:54.873 --> 00:00:55.790
- [Female Speaker] CNN.
- CNN.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:57.770
- He told me to cover my face.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:58.603
- [Male Speaker 1] One of the first things

00:00:58.603 --> 00:01:00.700
the Taliban did was
hold a press conference,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.830
where they assured the
people of Afghanistan

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:07.030
that they would not be going after revenge

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.180
on whoever worked for the United States,

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.370
or NATO, or any other outside country.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:16.710
- Because we have announced
general amnesty for everyone.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:19.970
The security forces, from
senior, to the junior level.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:22.970
And this fear, all this hysteria

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.440
that has taken place is unfounded.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.590
- [Male Speaker 1] This right here.

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:30.240
This is actually what I wanna talk about

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.510
in this short video.

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:34.360
I'm not making an
explainer on Afghanistan,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.750
I just wanna make one thing clear.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.810
When I heard the Taliban
speak in this way,

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.790
and talk about how they're different now,

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.540
and how they actually want to
build an inclusive society,

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.100
I wanted to believe them.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.277
I think a lot of us
wanted to believe like,

00:01:48.277 --> 00:01:50.180
"Well, what if they have changed?"

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:51.650
- [Translator] Our women
even have the same rights.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.050
They can work in different
sectors on the basis of our rules

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.330
and regulations, and education,
and health, and other areas.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:59.400
There will be no
discrimination against women.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.430
- But then my neighbor
came over last night.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:05.470
He and his wife and two
children moved from Afghanistan

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.780
just a couple of years ago.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.970
They were US contractors,
worked for the US government,

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:13.613
and their families are
currently still in Afghanistan.

00:02:13.613 --> 00:02:18.613
- I was working on the- to make something

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.493
for our community, for ourselves.

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:26.170
But we lost everything.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.940
- What I learned in this conversation

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:32.230
is that we should not believe
the Taliban, they are lying.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:36.610
They're putting on a show
of inclusion and change

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:39.410
in the name of trying to get
international recognition

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.790
for their new self-declared country.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:46.180
But in reality, they are
actually seeking revenge,

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:51.180
and imposing their dogmatic
rule on everyone around them,

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.630
and especially targeting those

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:58.000
who were a part of the US
military or civilian operations.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:02.500
They're going door-to-door,
hunting for anyone

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.570
who was involved with the US,

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.430
which is why you see scenes like this.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.223
People fleeing at whatever cost.

00:03:11.739 --> 00:03:14.820
(slow piano music)

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:19.700
- My brother, he used to work
with US government contracts,

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.610
direct, indirect, since 2010.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.930
My mother-in-law worked

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:30.110
with US government contract from 2013,

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:31.670
and some other colleagues.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:34.520
- [Neighbor] They are
searching house-by-house,

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:38.010
to find their targeted people.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:41.460
They are saying, "If you
do not give me the person

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:45.970
who used to work with this country,

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:50.220
we will- we are going to
kill, like, family members."

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:54.130
This is what it makes fear to our family.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:57.580
- It's easy to read the
news, and to package this up

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.360
in our minds as just an issue

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.570
that's happening far away,

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.700
that has to do with geopolitics,

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.490
and history, and newsy things.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:10.570
But after talking to
my neighbor last night,

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:14.220
it was a stark reminder
that this is human lives.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.150
People who have fled their homes,

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.040
who are living in hiding, right now,

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.320
who are scared for their lives.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:25.950
Children who now live in the
shadows, and live in fear,

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:30.070
and people who will do anything
to escape their country,

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.660
where they have roots and
culture and connections.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.460
It doesn't matter because
their life is in danger.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:40.480
- That's the reason that
they have moved from there,

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.740
like permanent resident.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:46.940
And they are living like,
few nights one place,

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.400
just to hide out.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:49.933
They are living in fear.

00:04:51.279 --> 00:04:55.033
And any time- even if we are not,

00:04:55.033 --> 00:04:58.130
even they are not in their
like permanent residence,

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:01.360
like their own house,
someone is knocking the door.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.400
They feel that the Taliban's there,

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.767
and they are coming after them.

00:05:06.767 --> 00:05:10.920
- When I'm thinking about
my 16-year-old sister,

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:13.703
it's very hard for me to think about.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.960
- I'm gonna think about
how I can tell the story

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.490
of Afghanistan, and how
it turned out like this.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:23.750
That is a story that needs
to be told and understood.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:27.730
But today I'm making this
video just to tell you

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:31.660
to remember that, as you read
about this and look into it,

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.460
you should not believe anything

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:36.260
the Taliban is saying; they're lying.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.540
They're lying to deceive all of us

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:42.350
so that they can continue
their brutal rule

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.140
towards the people that they now control.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:48.510
I also want you to
remember to think of this,

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:53.510
not just as another breaking
news, but as real lives,

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.140
people suffering, people living in fear.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:06:00.040
That's what this story is. And
it's playing out right now.

00:06:00.909 --> 00:06:03.826
(slow piano music)

